# Dev harness

- Target: Rancher Desktop with containerd + Kubernetes (`planning/05-dev-harness.md`).
- Namespace/services names stay stable (`qllm-dev`, `postgres`, `mysql`, `mongodb`, `test-api`).
- Seeds must keep cross-source keys aligned (`customer_id` / `customerId`).
- Test API may be Python/FastAPI; databases use official images.
- Dev credentials only in harness docs/manifests — never reuse as production defaults.
- Golden Query IR files live under `fixtures/queries/` and must validate against `query-ir.schema.json`.
- Include at least one forced-timeout scenario for fail-fast verification.
